("and they did it a long time ago.","CARD","a long horizontal hand-drawn timeline running across the frame, a small glowing yellow dot marked far over at the left end","a hand-lettered label under the dot reading \"77,000 YEARS AGO\"","white"),
("At Sibudu, a rock shelter in South Africa,","CARD","a hand-drawn map of southern Africa in flat sand-tan on a pale blue sea, one bold red map pin on the east coast with a thin leader line, and a small hand-drawn rock shelter icon beside it","a hand-lettered label beside the pin reading \"SIBUDU - SOUTH AFRICA\"","white"),
("archaeologists dug through fifteen separate layers of bedding.","CARD","a hand-drawn stratigraphic cross-section, fifteen thin horizontal layers stacked one on another in alternating pale green and brown, a thin bracket down the left side","a hand-lettered label beside the bracket reading \"15 LAYERS\"","white"),
("Stems and rushes, packed down flat,","CARD","a close hand-drawn view of one bedding layer, dried stems and rushes pressed flat and interwoven","a small hand-lettered label with a thin arrow reading \"STEMS\"","white"),
("a few centimetres thick.","CARD","the same layer seen from the side with a small hand-drawn measuring mark against its thickness","a small hand-lettered label reading \"A FEW CM\"","white"),
("Big enough to lie on.","SCENE_A","lying flat on his back on a thick mat of packed stems inside the shelter, hands behind his head",NT,"cave"),
("A mattress.","CARD","one hand-drawn bedding mat drawn large and centred, seen from slightly above, its edges frayed","large bold hand-lettered text beneath reading \"A MATTRESS.\"","white"),
("Seventy seven thousand years old.","CARD","a very large hand-lettered number filling the frame with the small hand-drawn bedding mat beneath it","the words \"77,000 YEARS OLD.\" very large and bold","white"),
("But that isn't the clever part.","SCENE_A","sitting on the edge of the bedding mat inside the shelter, raising one finger, deadpan",NT,"cave"),
("On top of it, thinner than tissue paper,","CARD","a hand-drawn side view of the bedding mat with one extremely thin extra layer drawn on top of it, and a thin arrow pointing at that layer",NT,"white"),
("was a layer of leaves from one particular tree.","CARD","the same side view with the top layer now drawn as overlapping green leaves, wrapped in a soft YELLOW GLOW","a small hand-lettered label with a thin arrow reading \"LEAVES\"","white"),
("Cape laurel.","CARD","one hand-drawn sprig of cape laurel drawn very large and centred, three glossy pointed leaves","large bold hand-lettered text beneath reading \"CAPE LAUREL.\"","white"),
("The leaves are full of compounds that kill insects,","CARD","one hand-drawn leaf drawn large with a mosquito beside it and a thick RED X over the mosquito",NT,"white"),
("and kill the larvae too.","CARD","the same leaf with a small hand-drawn pool of water beneath it holding larvae, all crossed out in red","a small hand-lettered label with a thin arrow reading \"LARVAE TOO\"","white"),
("They were sleeping on an insecticide.","SCENE_A","lying asleep on the leaf-covered bedding inside the shelter, eyes closed, calm","small hand-lettered sleep marks \"zzZz\" floating above his head","cave"),
("And I want to be careful here,","SCENE_A","sitting up on the bedding with one hand raised flat, a cautious look",NT,"cave"),
("because this is the part that's easy to oversell.","CARD","a hand-drawn set of scales tipping too far to one side, a small leaf on the heavy pan","a small hand-lettered label under the heavy pan reading \"TOO FAR\"","white"),
("Nobody can prove those leaves","CARD","one hand-drawn leaf drawn large in the centre with a hand-drawn question mark beside it",NT,"white"),
("were a wet season measure specifically.","CARD","the same leaf with a thin dashed arrow running toward a small rain cloud, the arrow crossed out with a red X","a small hand-lettered label under the dashed arrow reading \"NOT PROVEN\"","white"),
("What it proves is that seventy seven thousand years ago,","CARD","a large hand-lettered number filling the upper frame with a thin line drawn under it","the words \"WHAT IT DOES PROVE\" in a smaller thin hand-lettered line above, and \"77,000 YEARS AGO\" large and bold below","white"),
("people knew some plants keep insects off you,","SCENE_A","kneeling and picking a specific sprig of leaves from a low bush, examining it closely, sure of himself",NT,"forest"),
("and they used that on purpose, fifteen times over.","SCENE_A","kneeling on the bedding inside the shelter, laying a fresh handful of leaves down across the top of it",NT,"cave"),
("There's also a reason we found it at Sibudu","CARD","a comparison card split by a vertical dashed line, a hand-drawn dry rock shelter on the left with a green check, a hand-drawn dripping wet forest floor on the right with a red X","hand-lettered labels above reading \"SURVIVES\" and \"GONE\"","white"),
("and not somewhere wetter.","CARD","a hand-drawn map of Africa in flat sand-tan, the Congo rainforest area shaded flat green with a thick RED X over it","a small hand-lettered label under the map reading \"NOTHING SURVIVES\"","white"),
("The wet that rotted their feet","SCENE_A","sitting on wet ground looking down at his own pale ruined foot",NT,"rain_out"),
("rotted nearly everything else they left behind.","CARD","a hand-drawn cross-section of dark wet soil with a bone, a stick and a scrap of hide inside it, all drawn crumbling into nothing","a small hand-lettered label with a thin arrow reading \"ACIDIC SOIL\"","white"),
("Dry caves survive. Wet seasons don't.","CARD","a comparison card split by a vertical dashed line, a hand-drawn dry cave interior on the left, a hand-drawn flooded forest floor on the right","hand-lettered labels above reading \"DRY\" and \"WET\"","white"),
("So how does anyone work out which leaf to sleep on,","SCENE_A","standing holding two different sprigs of leaves, one in each hand, looking from one to the other",NT,"forest"),
("with no writing and no way to test it?","CARD","a hand-drawn scroll and a hand-drawn glass vial side by side, each with a thick RED X across it","small hand-lettered labels under each reading \"NO WRITING\" and \"NO TESTING\"","white"),
("You don't.","SCENE_A","standing with both arms out in a shrug, deadpan, looking straight at the viewer",NT,"cave"),
("Somebody's grandmother does, and she tells you.","SCENE_W","an old woman sitting by the fire holding out a sprig of leaves toward a younger figure beside her, mouth open mid-sentence",NT,"cave_fire"),
("Nobody wrote it down. Nobody could.","CARD","a hand-drawn scroll and quill drawn large with a thick RED X across them","a hand-lettered line beneath reading \"NEVER WRITTEN.\"","white"),
("They just knew,","GROUP","five of them sitting close around the fire inside the cave, one talking, the others listening, firelight on all their faces",NT,"cave_fire"),
("and they kept knowing, for tens of thousands of years.","GROUP","a long line of them stretching across the frame from left to right, each one turned slightly toward the next, a thin arrow running along the whole line","a hand-lettered label under the line reading \"PASSED ON\"","white"),
("Now, let's be honest about something,","SCENE_A","sitting by the fire, leaning forward slightly, one hand open, a level look at the viewer",NT,"cave_fire"),
("because so far this has gone quite well for you.","SCENE_A","the same seated figure, a small green check mark floating beside his head",NT,"cave_fire"),
("Bare feet. Tubers under the ground. Leaves that keep the insects off.","CARD","a row of three hand-drawn objects drawn large and evenly spaced: a bare foot, a fat tuber, a sprig of leaves, each with a small green check above it",NT,"white"),
("Every one of those answers","CARD","the same three objects with three thin lines running down from them and meeting at one point below",NT,"white"),
("has the same thing underneath it.","CARD","the same three lines meeting at one small hand-drawn fire wrapped in a soft YELLOW GLOW","a hand-lettered label beneath the fire reading \"WARM ENOUGH.\"","white"),
("You have to be warm enough to move.","SCENE_A","standing up from beside the fire, stretching, moving off toward the cave mouth",NT,"cave_fire"),
("Somebody cold enough doesn't dig,","SCENE_A","sitting hunched and shivering in the rain, a digging stick lying unused on the ground beside him","small hand-lettered shiver marks beside his shoulders","rain_out"),
("doesn't gather leaves, doesn't walk anywhere.","SCENE_A","the same hunched figure, arms wrapped tight around his knees, not moving",NT,"rain_out"),
("They sit down.","SCENE_A","the same figure seen small at a distance, a single seated shape alone in a wide flooded landscape",NT,"rain_out"),
("And in a wet season, sitting down is how it ends.","SCENE_A","the same wide landscape at dusk, the seated shape now barely visible, the light almost gone",NT,"rain_night"),
# ── CHƯƠNG 4 — LỬA + KẾT ─────
("Which brings us to fire.","CARD","a chapter title card, very large hand-lettered ALL-CAPS text with one large hand-drawn fire on a ring of stones beside it, wrapped in a warm yellow glow","the words \"4. THE FIRE\" very large and bold in black","white"),
("Not fire as a nice thing to sit near.","SCENE_M","sitting comfortably in an armchair beside a small decorative fireplace holding a mug, blanket over his knees, half-lidded eyes",NT,"modern"),
("Fire as the only source of heat that existed.","CARD","the same hand-drawn fire drawn very large and wrapped in a strong warm YELLOW GLOW filling most of the frame","a two-part hand-lettered line, thin reading \"THE ONLY\" then very large and bold reading \"HEAT THAT EXISTED.\"","white"),
("Here's the number that makes rain lethal","SCENE_A","sitting close beside the fire with his arms out toward it, soaked through, firelight on his face",NT,"cave_fire"),
("instead of miserable.","SCENE_A","the same seated figure seen a little wider, the rain hammering past the cave mouth behind him",NT,"cave_fire"),
("A wet body loses heat","CARD","a comparison card split by a vertical dashed line, the caveman stickman drawn dry on the left with two small red heat arrows leaving him, and drawn soaked on the right with a dense burst of red heat arrows leaving him in every direction","hand-lettered labels under the two figures reading \"DRY\" and \"WET\"","white"),
("up to twenty five times faster than a dry one.","CARD","the same comparison card, the numbers now written large under each figure, the right-hand number drawn in RED","hand-lettered numbers under the two figures reading \"1x\" and \"25x\", the \"25x\" in red","white"),
("Not twenty five percent. Twenty five times.","CARD","a very large hand-lettered figure filling the frame, with a small percent sign drawn beside it crossed out in red","the words \"25 TIMES.\" very large and bold, and a small crossed-out \"25%\" beside them","white"),
("So the fire isn't comfort.","SCENE_A","sitting bolt upright right beside the fire, not relaxed at all, eyes open and watchful, hands ready",NT,"cave_fire"),
("The fire is the reason you wake up.","SCENE_A","lying asleep on his side close beside the fire inside the cave, calm, the firelight warm across him","small hand-lettered sleep marks \"zzZz\" above his head","cave_fire"),
("And rain is the single best thing in nature","SCENE_A","standing at the cave mouth looking out at a wall of hammering rain, spear in one hand",NT,"cave_mouth"),
("at putting fire out.","SCENE_A","crouched over a fire at the cave mouth as rain drives in onto it, the flames flattened, grey smoke and steam rising","small hand-lettered sounds \"HISSSS\" beside the steam","cave_mouth"),
("Now, you're probably picturing someone","SCENE_M","standing on the wet street holding two stones together, pretending to strike them, pleased with himself",NT,"street"),
("striking a stone to get it back.","CARD","two hand-drawn stones drawn large being struck together with a small bright spark and a soft yellow glow between them",NT,"white"),
("For most of human history,","CARD","the same two stones with a thick RED X drawn across them","a hand-lettered line beneath reading \"NOT AN OPTION.\"","white"),
("that was not an option.","SCENE_A","kneeling over a dead grey fire, striking two stones together, nothing happening, face set",NT,"cave"),
("The oldest fire sites, in Kenya and in South Africa,","CARD","a hand-drawn map of Africa in flat sand-tan on a pale blue sea with two bold red map pins, one in east Africa and one in the south, each with a thin leader line","hand-lettered labels beside the pins reading \"KENYA\" and \"SOUTH AFRICA\"","white"),
("go back one point six million years.","CARD","a very large hand-lettered number filling the frame with a small hand-drawn fire beneath it","the words \"1.6 MILLION YEARS.\" very large and bold","white"),
("And those people were not making fire.","SCENE_A","kneeling over a dead grey fire striking two stones together again and again, no spark, shoulders tight with effort",NT,"cave"),
("They were collecting it.","SCENE_A","crouching at the edge of a burnt patch of ground lifting one glowing ember into a folded piece of bark, warm light on his hands",NT,"dry_plain"),
("From lightning strikes.","SCENE_A","seen small at a distance watching from a rise as a fork of lightning strikes a lone tree across the valley and sets it alight",NT,"rain_night"),
("From wildfires.","SCENE_A","standing at a distance in front of a low line of grass fire burning across the plain, orange light on him, smoke drifting",NT,"dry_plain"),
("They took embers from something the sky had already set alight,","SCENE_A","crouching at the edge of a burnt patch, lifting a glowing ember into a cupped piece of bark with a stick",NT,"dry_plain"),
("and carried them home.","SCENE_A","walking carefully with both hands cupped around a small glowing ember, a warm yellow glow on his face and chest, dusk around him",NT,"rain_night"),
("So for over a million years,","CARD","a long horizontal hand-drawn timeline running the width of the frame with a small fire drawn above the left end and above the right end","a hand-lettered label above the line reading \"1,000,000 YEARS\"","white"),
("if your fire went out, you did not relight it.","SCENE_A","kneeling over a fire that has gone out, pushing the cold grey ash apart with one finger, nothing left glowing",NT,"cave"),
("You waited for the sky to strike something.","SCENE_A","sitting at the cave mouth looking up at a heavy dark sky, waiting, nothing happening",NT,"cave_mouth"),
("And in a wet season,","SCENE_A","the same seated figure with rain now driving in past him, the cave floor wet",NT,"cave_mouth"),
("the sky is busy doing the exact opposite.","SCENE_A","standing out in the open at night with rain driving down hard, no light anywhere, arms wrapped around himself",NT,"rain_night"),
("So somebody sat with it.","SCENE_A","sitting cross-legged directly beside the fire, feeding it one small stick, wide awake",NT,"cave_fire"),
("Not as a chore.","SCENE_A","the same seated figure, face serious and focused, eyes on the flames, not bored",NT,"cave_fire"),
("Somebody in that group did nothing else.","GROUP","the whole band inside the cave, most of them working at other things around the edges, one figure sitting alone right beside the fire doing only that","a small hand-lettered label box in the top corner reading \"FIRE KEEPER\"","cave_fire"),
("Not hunting. Not digging. Not gathering.","SCENE_A","sitting beside the fire watching the others walk away out of the cave mouth, one carrying a spear, one a digging stick, one a basket",NT,"cave_fire"),
("Just the fire.","CARD","one hand-drawn fire drawn very large and centred, wrapped in a warm YELLOW GLOW, nothing else in the frame",NT,"white"),
("In a group of thirty people who are already hungry,","GROUP","a wide view of about thirty of them spread across the cave floor, thin and hunched, some lying down, the fire small in the middle",NT,"cave_fire"),
("one of them is doing nothing but watching something burn.","GROUP","the same wide cave view, one single figure beside the fire wrapped in a soft YELLOW GLOW while everyone else is drawn plain",NT,"cave_fire"),
("That's what it was worth.","CARD","a hand-drawn set of scales, one pan holding a small fire and the other holding a full day's food, the fire pan sitting lower","a hand-lettered line beneath reading \"THAT'S THE PRICE.\"","white"),
("They paid it every wet season, for a million years.","GROUP","a long horizontal line of small seated figures stretching across the frame, each one beside a small fire, receding into the distance",NT,"white"),
("Eventually that changed,","SCENE_A","kneeling over a fresh fire, holding up a small dull yellow stone and looking at it closely",NT,"cave"),
("and it changed in the most ordinary way possible.","SCENE_A","the same kneeling figure knocking the yellow stone against a flint, a single spark jumping off",NT,"cave"),
("At a site called Barnham in Suffolk,","CARD","a hand-drawn map of Britain in flat sand-tan on a pale blue sea, one bold red map pin in the east of England with a thin leader line","a hand-lettered label beside the pin reading \"BARNHAM - SUFFOLK\"","white"),
("there's a hearth about four hundred thousand years old.","CARD","a hand-drawn overhead view of a ring of blackened hearth stones with dark ash inside it","a large hand-lettered line beneath reading \"400,000 YEARS OLD.\"","white"),
("Beside it, pieces of iron pyrite.","CARD","two hand-drawn lumps of iron pyrite drawn large and centred, dull brassy gold with rough faces","large bold hand-lettered text beneath reading \"IRON PYRITE.\"","white"),
