("carrying a small kit.","SCENE_A","a close-up of the small leather pouch tied at his hip, his hand resting on it, the mountain light cold and pale",NT,"dry_plain"),
("Flint, pyrite, and a dried fungus","CARD","a hand-drawn kit layout, four objects arranged with space around them: a flint blade, a lump of pyrite, a dried bracket fungus, and a bundle of plant tinder","a hand-lettered heading above reading \"THE FIRE KIT\", and small labels under each item reading \"FLINT\", \"PYRITE\", \"FUNGUS\", \"TINDER\"","white"),
("that catches a spark and holds it.","CARD","a hand-drawn cutaway of the dried fungus with a small ember glowing deep inside it, wrapped in a soft yellow glow","a small hand-lettered label with a thin arrow reading \"HOLDS IT\"","white"),
("He carried it everywhere, because you would.","SCENE_A","walking a high mountain path with the small pouch tied at his hip, one hand resting on it",NT,"dry_plain"),
("Everybody in that line kept it burning","GROUP","a long horizontal line of them stretching across the frame, each one handing a small flame on to the next, a thin arrow running along the whole line",NT,"white"),
("long enough to hand it on.","GROUP","the same line, the flame now reaching the far right end where one figure holds it up, the whole line wrapped in a faint warm glow",NT,"white"),
("That isn't a nice thought.","SCENE_A","sitting alone by the fire looking straight at the viewer, flat mouth, not smiling",NT,"cave_fire"),
("It's just what had to happen for you to be here.","SCENE_A","the same seated figure, and behind him on the cave wall his shadow drawn long and steady",NT,"cave_fire"),
("Rain starts.","SCENE_M","standing still on the pavement looking up as the first drops land, exactly as at the very beginning","small hand-lettered rain sounds \"tap. tap.\" floating beside his head","street"),
