("and behind that door there is heat","SCENE_M","standing inside with the door shut behind him, a warm glow filling the room around him",NT,"modern"),
("that nobody in your family has to sit up all night to protect.","GROUP","a comparison card drawn as two scenes side by side split by a vertical dashed line, the modern guy asleep on his sofa on the left, and on the right one caveman sitting up wide awake beside a fire","hand-lettered labels above the two halves reading \"YOU\" and \"THEM\"","white"),
("Somewhere in a kitchen drawer","SCENE_M","pulling open a kitchen drawer and looking down into it, the warm room around him",NT,"modern"),
